text:
Traeger continues to raise the bar with every release. The Pro 575 combines the original Traeger features that everyone loves with WiFire technology that takes hands-off to a whole new level. In addition the D2 Direct Drive is bullet proof. With the ability to monitor your cook from anywhere combined with recipes on the Traeger app that dummy proof cooking there is NO reason we all can’t be grilling several nights a week!!! 

CJ Russell 
@smokin_trinity_bbq

I do A LOT of grilling/smoking/baking on my traeger.  I have one I take camping, a few I take tailgating and it is just a superior piece of equipment.  I have had several friends, family members and strangers purchase grills of their own after eating one of my cooks.  Traeger makes grilling fun and easy.  Whether you imitate their recipes, tweak family recipes or experiment Traeger will not disappoint.  

-JP SLC, UT 
@traegerpapi
